    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dirt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake up, you find yourself devoid of all memories, strictly watched over by an old man. Through a diary, you learn your supposed mission\u2014to become a hero and save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what awaits you is far from the journey you expected...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dirt</strong> is a hand-drawn pixel-art JRPG where both the art style and the enemies you face are as absurd as they are eerie. Explore a world steeped in nostalgia, accompanied by retro music. The gameplay is based on a classic turn-based strategy battle system, making it easy to pick up. The story revolves around a deep exploration of freedom, using absurd storytelling to provoke serious thought, ultimately revealing the truth about both the world and yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Turn-based strategy combat, story-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Style:</strong> Hand-drawn, pixel-art, eerie and surreal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong> Nostalgic, retro soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong> Five narrative-rich chapters, absurd storytelling, profound exploration of freedom and fate.\u00a0Three endings: Real End (Mars Colonization), Normal End (Return to Reality), and True End (Journey to Find the Soul). Please clear True End.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Five Story Chapters</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awakening:</strong> Wake up in a cozy little house and uncover the enemies you'll soon face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Betrayal:</strong> Six months later, discover the corpses of your companions in a goblin nest, hunt down the killer, and avenge them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape:</strong> Retrieve your stolen eyes and break free from the Grand Prison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confrontation:</strong> Defeat the King of the Undead and save the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revelation:</strong> Uncover the truth about this world\u2014and yourself. Make your final choice.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dirt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake up, you find yourself devoid of all memories, strictly watched over by an old man. Through a diary, you learn your supposed mission\u2014to become a hero and save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what awaits you is far from the journey you expected...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dirt</strong> is a hand-drawn pixel-art JRPG where both the art style and the enemies you face are as absurd as they are eerie. Explore a world steeped in nostalgia, accompanied by retro music. The gameplay is based on a classic turn-based strategy battle system, making it easy to pick up. The story revolves around a deep exploration of freedom, using absurd storytelling to provoke serious thought, ultimately revealing the truth about both the world and yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Turn-based strategy combat, story-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Style:</strong> Hand-drawn, pixel-art, eerie and surreal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong> Nostalgic, retro soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong> Five narrative-rich chapters, absurd storytelling, profound exploration of freedom and fate.\u00a0Three endings: Real End (Mars Colonization), Normal End (Return to Reality), and True End (Journey to Find the Soul). Please clear True End.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Five Story Chapters</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awakening:</strong> Wake up in a cozy little house and uncover the enemies you'll soon face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Betrayal:</strong> Six months later, discover the corpses of your companions in a goblin nest, hunt down the killer, and avenge them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape:</strong> Retrieve your stolen eyes and break free from the Grand Prison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confrontation:</strong> Defeat the King of the Undead and save the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revelation:</strong> Uncover the truth about this world\u2014and yourself. Make your final choice.</p></li></ul>",
